{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-64866","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123623","text":"stackdocs — the whole [&] stack, as a filesystem you can walk"}]},{"id":"blk-64867","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123624","text":"A single, navigable documentation site that "},{"id":"spn-123625","marks":["bold"],"text":"mirrors the live repository's filesystem"},{"id":"spn-123626","text":": every real "},{"id":"spn-123627","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-123628","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-123629","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-123630","text":" markdown file across all 43 projects — plus each project's own root-level markdown, where TRVM, TRAAVIIS and WRL keep nearly all of theirs — becomes a page whose route "},{"id":"spn-123631","marks":["italic"],"text":"is"},{"id":"spn-123632","text":" its source path. No files are moved. Open "},{"id":"spn-123633","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/index.html"},{"id":"spn-123634","text":" — single file, no server."}]},{"id":"blk-64868","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123635","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-64869","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123636","text":"The home page is a "},{"id":"spn-123637","marks":["bold"],"text":"Runefort campus"},{"id":"spn-123638","text":": the stack rendered as a place you can walk. Directories are floors (campus → building → floor), documents are rooms. The left rail is the real filesystem tree; the top bar is a live breadcrumb of the current path. Each document page shows its "},{"id":"spn-123639","marks":["bold"],"text":"source path"},{"id":"spn-123640","text":" (with a copy button), the rendered markdown, and a right rail of typed neighbors: outgoing links, "},{"id":"spn-123641","marks":["bold"],"text":"backlinks"},{"id":"spn-123642","text":" (\"referenced by\"), and siblings in the same folder."}]},{"id":"blk-64870","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123643","text":"Because "},{"id":"spn-123644","marks":["code"],"text":"route === source path"},{"id":"spn-123645","text":", an AI agent reading the rendered docs can round- trip back to the exact file on disk, and vice-versa. "},{"id":"spn-123646","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-123647","text":" is the machine-readable route⇄source map for exactly this."}]},{"id":"blk-64871","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123648","text":"How it dogfoods the stack (in the build, not as metaphor)"}]},{"id":"blk-64872","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123649","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123650","text":" uses the real "},{"id":"spn-123651","marks":["code"],"text":"@bendscript/core"},{"id":"spn-123652","text":" npm package to:"}]},{"id":"blk-64873","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64875","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123653","marks":["bold"],"text":"Mirror the filesystem"},{"id":"spn-123654","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-123655","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123656","text":" scans the repo (excluding"}]}],"id":"blk-64874","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-64876","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123657","marks":["code"],"text":"node_modules"},{"id":"spn-123658","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123659","marks":["code"],"text":"_build"},{"id":"spn-123660","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123661","marks":["code"],"text":"deps"},{"id":"spn-123662","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123663","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scrap"},{"id":"spn-123664","text":", and every dot-directory except "},{"id":"spn-123665","marks":["code"],"text":".claude"},{"id":"spn-123666","text":", so gitignored local state like "},{"id":"spn-123667","marks":["code"],"text":".amp/"},{"id":"spn-123668","text":" is never published), collecting every "},{"id":"spn-123669","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-123670","text":"+"},{"id":"spn-123671","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-123672","text":" "},{"id":"spn-123673","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-123674","text":" file, each project's root-level markdown, and the top-level stack docs. 350 docs / 43 projects."}]},{"id":"blk-64877","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64879","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123675","marks":["bold"],"text":"Turn each file into a validated BendScript document"},{"id":"spn-123676","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-123677","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123678","text":" parses"}]}],"id":"blk-64878","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-64880","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123679","text":"the markdown to blocks; "},{"id":"spn-123680","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123681","text":" emits BendScript; each doc is validated against the protocol schema, normalized, and "},{"id":"spn-123682","marks":["bold"],"text":"content-addressed"},{"id":"spn-123683","text":" (CIDv1). The CID is shown in the reader rail — change a file, its id changes."}]},{"id":"blk-64881","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64883","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123684","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type every cross-doc link as an edge"},{"id":"spn-123685","text":" — relative "},{"id":"spn-123686","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-123687","text":" links that resolve"}]}],"id":"blk-64882","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-64884","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123688","text":"to a known route become internal navigation; the graph is inverted to produce backlinks. Unresolvable links degrade gracefully (never fail the build)."}]},{"id":"blk-64885","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64887","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123689","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify the round-trip invariant"},{"id":"spn-123690","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-123691","marks":["code"],"text":"parse(serialize(parse(d)))"},{"id":"spn-123692","text":" is checked"}]}],"id":"blk-64886","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-64888","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123693","text":"to be a CID fixpoint across the whole corpus — the protocol's load-bearing claim, now proven over 223 real documents."}]},{"id":"blk-64889","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123694","text":"The campus "},{"id":"spn-123695","marks":["italic"],"text":"is"},{"id":"spn-123696","text":" Runefort's "},{"id":"spn-123697","marks":["code"],"text":"codebase-atlas"},{"id":"spn-123698","text":" idea; the pages "},{"id":"spn-123699","marks":["italic"],"text":"are"},{"id":"spn-123700","text":" BendScript's \"prose is one projection of the graph.\" The medium is the message."}]},{"id":"blk-64890","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123701","text":"Robustness: the build never breaks on real content"}]},{"id":"blk-64891","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123702","text":"Real markdown is messy. The ingest pipeline falls back to a raw code-block view for any document it can't cleanly parse, counting fallbacks in the build report (currently "},{"id":"spn-123703","marks":["bold"],"text":"0"},{"id":"spn-123704","text":"). So new or unusual docs join the atlas automatically without ever failing the build."}]},{"id":"blk-64892","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123705","text":"Build it"}]},{"id":"blk-64893","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"npm i                 # box-and-box + @bendscript/core\nnpm run build         # node build-atlas.mjs → dist/index.html + dist/atlas.json + dist/bend/*\nnpm run build:curated # the earlier 21-page curated proof (node build.mjs)"},{"id":"blk-64894","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123706","text":"Build report (actual output):"}]},{"id":"blk-64895","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  ✓ 350 real docs mirrored from 43 projects (no files moved)\n  ✓ route === source path for every page (lossless agent round-trip)\n  ✓ 360 cross-doc links resolved to internal navigation\n  ✓ every page is a validated, content-addressed BendScript document\n  ✓ round-trip CID fixpoint holds across the corpus: true\n  ✓ 0 doc(s) fell back to raw view (unparseable markdown)"},{"id":"blk-64896","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123707","text":"Extending it"}]},{"id":"blk-64897","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64899","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123708","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add docs:"},{"id":"spn-123709","text":" just add markdown under any project's "},{"id":"spn-123710","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-123711","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-123712","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-123713","text":". The"}]}],"id":"blk-64898","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-64900","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123714","text":"next build picks it up — it joins the tree, the floors, search, and the graph."}]},{"id":"blk-64901","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64903","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123715","marks":["bold"],"text":"Point an agent at it:"},{"id":"spn-123716","text":" read "},{"id":"spn-123717","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-123718","text":" for the "},{"id":"spn-123719","marks":["code"],"text":"route ⇄ source"}]}],"id":"blk-64902","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-64904","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123720","text":"mapping, or read any "},{"id":"spn-123721","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/bend/<slug>.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-123722","text":" for the content-addressed BendScript form of a single file."}]},{"id":"blk-64905","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123723","text":"Files"}]},{"id":"blk-64906","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64908","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123724","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123725","text":" — the filesystem-mirror build (primary)"}]}],"id":"blk-64907","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64910","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123726","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123727","text":" — repo scan → filesystem tree + route↔source map"}]}],"id":"blk-64909","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64912","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123728","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123729","text":" — markdown → BendScript blocks (with raw-view fallback)"}]}],"id":"blk-64911","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64914","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123730","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123731","text":" — BendScript → HTML, link resolution"}]}],"id":"blk-64913","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64916","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123732","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.css"},{"id":"spn-123733","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-123734","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.js"},{"id":"spn-123735","text":" — the Runefort campus client"}]}],"id":"blk-64915","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64918","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123736","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/"},{"id":"spn-123737","text":" — built site ("},{"id":"spn-123738","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-123739","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123740","marks":["code"],"text":"atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-123741","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123742","marks":["code"],"text":"bend/*.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-123743","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-64917","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64920","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123744","marks":["code"],"text":"build.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123745","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-123746","marks":["code"],"text":"content.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123747","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-123748","marks":["code"],"text":"sources.mjs"},{"id":"spn-123749","text":" — the earlier curated 21-page proof"}]}],"id":"blk-64919","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraehmoillol4nc2gpirtbrobuezcmnbbxgpyygz7glwwwodzlez5vq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}